---
/**
 * Interactive figure of the lesson « Groupes cycliques »: a dial of n
 * positions on which a hand moves by a step k at each gesture. The dial, its
 * text reading and the history table are rendered at build time;
 * src/scripts/cycle-figures.ts makes the controls live.
 * Usage in MDX: <CycleFigure number="1" />
 */
import { CYCLE_PRESET, HISTORY_MAX, LIMITS, cycleText, startState } from '../../figures/cycle';
import { cycleSvg, HEIGHT, WIDTH } from '../../figures/cycle-svg';
import '../../styles/figures.css';
import '../../styles/figures-cycle.css';

interface Props { number?: string }
const { number } = Astro.props;
const id = 'figure-cadran';
const state = startState();
const text = cycleText(state);
const fields = [
  { name: 'n', label: 'Nombre de positions n', value: CYCLE_PRESET.n },
  { name: 'k', label: 'Pas k', value: CYCLE_PRESET.k },
] as const;
---
<figure class="plane-figure series-figure cycle-figure" id={id} data-cycle-figure aria-labelledby={`${id}-title`}>
  <figcaption class="plane-figure-caption">
    <span class="eyebrow">Figure{number && ` ${number}`} · interactive</span>
    <span class="plane-figure-title" id={`${id}-title`}>Le cadran et son pas</span>
  </figcaption>
  <div class="plane-figure-layout">
    <div class="plane-figure-stage">
      <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${WIDTH} ${HEIGHT}`} role="img" aria-labelledby={`${id}-title ${id}-status`} data-cycle-svg set:html={cycleSvg(state)} />
      <p class="plane-figure-hint">
        Le cadran a n positions numérotées de 0 à n − 1 ; l’aiguille part de 0 et l’anneau marque la position courante. Les points pleins sont les positions déjà atteintes. Ce sont des positions discrètes, non une trajectoire physique. La plage est finie (n de {LIMITS.n[0]} à {LIMITS.n[1]}, k de −{LIMITS.k[1]} à {LIMITS.k[1]}) : la figure explore des exemples et n’est pas une preuve.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="plane-figure-side">
      <div class="plane-controls" role="group" aria-label="Cadran et pas">
        {fields.map(({ name, label, value }) => (
          <label class="plane-field">
            <span>{label}</span>
            <input type="number" inputmode="numeric" step="1" min={LIMITS[name][0]} max={LIMITS[name][1]} value={value} data-param={name} disabled />
          </label>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="plane-actions">
        <button type="button" class="button secondary" data-action="forward" disabled>Avancer d’un pas</button>
        <button type="button" class="button secondary" data-action="backward" disabled>Reculer d’un pas</button>
        <button type="button" class="button primary" data-action="reset" disabled>Recommencer</button>
      </div>
      <dl class="plane-reading" data-cycle-rows>
        {text.rows.map(([term, value]) => <div><dt>{term}</dt><dd>{value}</dd></div>)}
      </dl>
      <p class="plane-status" id={`${id}-status`} role="status" aria-live="polite" data-cycle-status>{text.status}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="cycle-history-note" id={`${id}-table-caption`}>Historique des positions (au plus {HISTORY_MAX} gestes). <span data-cycle-note>{text.historyNote}</span></p>
  <div class="table-scroll series-table" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-labelledby={`${id}-table-caption`}>
    <table aria-labelledby={`${id}-table-caption`}>
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Geste</th><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Position</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody data-cycle-table>
        {text.table.map(row => <tr>{row.map(cell => <td>{cell}</td>)}</tr>)}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <p class="technical-note">Les calculs sont exacts (entiers). Modifier n ou k remet le cadran au départ. La figure ne démontre rien et ne remplace pas les démonstrations de la leçon.</p>
  <noscript><p class="technical-note">Activez JavaScript pour modifier la figure. La figure, ses valeurs initiales et l’historique restent lisibles.</p></noscript>
</figure>
<script>
  import { initCycleFigure } from '../../scripts/cycle-figures';
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-cycle-figure]').forEach(initCycleFigure);
</script>
